# Working copies with tenant-specific values: country lists, IP ranges, break-glass account ids,
# output of the readiness and prerequisite scripts. This repo holds templates for every tenant; a
# value that ends up here once stays in the history forever, even after a commit that removes it.
# Whatever is in local/ never goes along — also not to a mirror (scripts/sync-mirror.js copies
# only what git tracks).
/local/
